erything compiles and installs okay, the emulator is running, I start abrmd=
 with 'sudo -u tss /tmp/tpm2/sbin/tpm2-abrmd --tcti=3Dlibtss2-tcti-mssim.s'=
 and the emulator says 'Client accepted'.  However, when I then run, say, t=
pm2_pcrlist, I get this error:

